WEBVTT

00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:31.402
tabassumga yo’yganlar.

00:02:31.941 --> 00:02:33.633
Papua Yangi Gvineyadan tortib

00:02:33.657 --> 00:02:36.831
Gollivudgacha,

00:02:36.855 --> 00:02:40.267
Beijingdagi zamonaviy san’atga qadar,

00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:41.696
biz tez-tez jilmayamiz,

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:45.172
va tabassum vositasida shodlik va 
mamnunlikni ifodalaymiz.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.976
Bu zaldagi insonlardan necha nafari
kuniga 20 martadan ortiq jilmayadi?

00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:50.735
Shunday bo'lsa, qo'lingizni

00:02:51.361 --> 00:02:52.520
ko'taring. Voyvo.

00:02:52.902 --> 00:02:54.401
Bu zaldan tashqarida,

00:02:54.425 --> 00:02:57.735
uchdan birimizdan ko'prog’i 
kuniga 20 martadan ko’proq jilmayadi,

00:02:57.759 --> 00:03:01.926
va 14 foizimizdan kamrog’imiz 
5 martadan kamroq tabassum qilamiz.